  1  Interrupt source is assigned to Interrupt Line 1</description>
                            <bitOffset>0x18</bitOffset>
                            <bitWidth>0x1</bitWidth>
                            <access>read-write</access>
                        </field>
                        <field>
                            <name>MCAN_ILS_BOL</name>
                            <description>Bus_Off Status Line
  0  Interrupt source is assigned to Interrupt Line 0
  1  Interrupt source is assigned to Interrupt Line 1</description>
                            <bitOffset>0x19</bitOffset>
                            <bitWidth>0x1</bitWidth>
                            <access>read-write</access>
                        </field>
                        <field>
                            <name>MCAN_ILS_WDIL</name>
                            <description>Watchdog Interrupt Line
  0  Interrupt source is assigned to Interrupt Line 0
  1  Interrupt source is assigned to Interrupt Line 1</description>
